      "name": "Code in JavaScript"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Quiz Retrieval\n\nThis workflow gets a previously created quiz from Supabase and sends it to the React application.\n\n## Simple Flow\n\n1. Receive → React sends the quiz_id.\n2. Find Quiz → Get the quiz details from Supabase.\n3. Find Questions → Get all questions matching that quiz_id.\n4. Combine → Organize the quiz and questions into one response.\n5. Respond → Send the complete quiz back to React.\n\n## In short:\nReact → Quiz ID → Get Quiz → Get Questions → Combine → Return Quiz",
